    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like i'm just going through the motions. i look at his side of the bed and it just feels like a constant reminder that half of me is gone. i'm so tired of fighting to stay here when he's not. it doesn't even feel like living anymore, just waiting.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
